WEBVTT

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.200
Yes! That's it! Now try to make your squats deeper!

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.500
Nice deep squat! Keep it up!

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.900
It's air jump rope, not air rope. Jump!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.000
There we go!

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.400
That's one. Hands closer together.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.000
Good.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.700
Wrong arm! Stretch the right arm!

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.000
Yes! Now pull your arm across.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.700
Keep your core engaged so your hips don't sway.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.000
Yes! That's it! Keep going!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.300
Your arms should move in sync with your legs.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.500
Arms and legs out at the same time!

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.200
Get those hands out of your pockets.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.700
Love your range of motion here.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:03.000
That's 10. What? Did you think I'd count the one's without your arms?

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.900
Come back up to the initial position to complete one rep.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.200
Yes! That's one rep!

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.700
2 reps!

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.000
3 reps!

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:23.900
We need a wide stance here. Protect those precious knees.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:28.600
I like your stance! Now, try to squat down lower!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:33.000
10 reps! Keep going and try to squat down lower!!

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:39.800
Speedy! Make sure your squats are deep and your punches fully extended.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:44.400
Take out your frustration for having to do so many squats by kicking!

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.600
Nice, you’re at ten reps, keep trying to kick higher.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:55.000
Deeper squats please! You were doing fine with the squats before. Don't give up!
